  95: ///
  96: /// [ToolbarController] recomputes a fresh snapshot every time the host
  97: /// controller notifies, then exposes it via [ToolbarController.state]. The
  98: /// snapshot is immutable and value-equal, so callers can short-circuit
  99: /// rebuilds when nothing changed.
