**Considering text formatting options**

I’m thinking about whether collapsed styles could allow future text insertion. It seems like the existing FormatTextCommand does nothing if the target is collapsed. If the user wants "配置字体颜色," it might be better to make the default font color adjustable in the editor's constructor, rather than just applying color to selected text. I wonder what "配置字体颜色" means. It probably relates to setting text color in the editor’s display or theme configuration. I’ll need to check the constructor of `WenzRichTextEditor`.
