   1: /// Wenz RichText — self-owned rich text editor.
   2: ///
   3: /// # API stability (as of stage 6)
   4: ///
   5: /// This package is pre-`0.1.0` and its public surface is still stabilising.
   6: /// APIs fall into three tiers:
   7: ///
   8: /// - **Stable core (tier 1)**: document model
   9: ///   ([RichTextDocument], [BlockNode], [InlineNode], [TableModel],
  10: ///   [CommentAnchor], [CommentThread], [CommentEntry], [RevisionRange],
  11: ///   [RevisionChange]),
  12: ///   position/selection model ([DocumentPosition], [DocumentSelection],
  13: ///   [PositionPath]), [WenzRichTextController] (including the incremental-
  14: ///   rebuild signal [WenzRichTextController.lastChangedBlockIds]),
  15: ///   [HistoryManager], the core
  16: ///   text/block/style commands ([InsertTextCommand], [DeleteSelectionCommand],
  17: ///   [EnterCommand], [FormatTextCommand], [SetBlockTypeCommand], …), the
  18: ///   selection commands ([MoveCaretCommand], [MoveCaretByWordCommand],
  19: ///   [MoveCaretToBlockBoundaryCommand], [MoveCaretToDocumentBoundaryCommand],
  20: ///   [SelectAllCommand], [MoveTableCellCommand],
  21: ///   [MoveTableCellVerticalCommand]), [ClipboardService], and
  22: ///   [EditorTextInputClient]. These are the intended integration points and
  23: ///   change only with a documented reason.
  24: /// - **Stabilising (tier 2)**: [WenzRichTextEditor] widget,
  25: ///   [WenzRichTextEditorAccessibility], [DocumentSchema],
  26: ///   the rich/legacy JSON codecs, the plain-text codec ([PlainTextCodec]),
  27: ///   the Markdown codec ([MarkdownCodec]), the HTML codec ([HtmlCodec]),
  28: ///   the schema migration framework ([DocumentMigration],
  29: ///   [DocumentMigrationRegistry], [V1ToV2DocumentMigration]), semantic inline
  30: ///   commands ([SetLinkCommand], [AutoLinkUrlsCommand], [ToggleMarkCommand],
  31: ///   [InsertInlineEmbedCommand]) and controller helpers for formula, mention,
  32: ///   emoji, inline image embeds, and block embeds, block structure commands
  33: ///   ([IndentCommand], [ToggleTodoCommand], [SetTodoCheckedCommand],
  34: ///   [SetCodeLanguageCommand],
  35: ///   [IndentCodeBlockCommand], [SetCalloutVariantCommand],
  36: ///   [UpdateCalloutBlockCommand], [ToggleQuoteCommand]), media-block commands
  37: ///   ([InsertVideoBlockCommand], [UpdateImageBlockCommand],
  38: ///   [UpdateFileBlockCommand], [UpdateVideoBlockCommand],
  39: ///   [DeleteVideoBlockCommand]), the command pipeline/registry
  40: ///   ([CommandMiddleware], [CommandRegistry], [CommandDescriptor],
  41: ///   [WenzEditorPermission]), the plugin
  42: ///   install surface ([WenzRichTextPlugin], [WenzPluginBundle],
  43: ///   [WenzPluginContext], [WenzPluginApiStatus]), the
  44: ///   callout block model ([CalloutBlockNode] with variant/title/icon metadata),
  45: ///   generic business block embed model ([BlockEmbedNode]),
  46: ///   rendering extension point ([BlockRendererRegistry],
  47: ///   [BlockRendererBuilder], [BlockRenderContext], [TableToolbarActionIntent],
  48: ///   [WenzObjectBlockSurface], [MediaResolver], [InlineEmbedRenderer],
  49: ///   [InlineEmbedRendererRegistry]), video insertion via slash menu / toolbar
  50: ///   helpers without a bundled player dependency, the
  51: ///   toolbar binding ([ToolbarController], [ToolbarState],
  52: ///   [WenzToolbarItemRegistry]), the controller change
  53: ///   callbacks ([WenzRichTextController.onChanged],
  54: ///   [WenzRichTextController.onSelectionChanged],
  55: ///   [WenzRichTextController.onCommandExecuted]), find/replace state and UI
  56: ///   ([WenzFindReplaceController], [FindReplaceMatch],
  57: ///   [FindReplaceOptions], [WenzFindReplacePanel]), slash-menu state and UI
  58: ///   ([SlashMenuController], [SlashMenuRegistry], [SlashMenuItem],
